{"5304140":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Witnesses","steam_appid":5304140,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witnesses<\/strong> is a detective visual novel in a grim noir style. You are a private detective assigned two strange cases. Where do you start? How do you proceed? Is there a connection between them? The choice is yours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the gloomy atmosphere of a small town where something is off. Listen to the whispers of suspicious cultists, gather all the evidence, and reveal the Truth to the world!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two parallel investigations that you pursue in any order<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual black-and-white visuals mixed with real photographs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather evidence, connect the facts – build your own version of events<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of noir investigation and absurdity: disappearances, cults, mad scientists, and evil corporations! And maybe even aliens…<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate witnesses: pressure them, empathize, eavesdrop – unravel the tangle of secrets!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witnesses<\/strong> is a detective visual novel in a grim noir style. You are a private detective assigned two strange cases. Where do you start? How do you proceed? Is there a connection between them? The choice is yours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the gloomy atmosphere of a small town where something is off. Listen to the whispers of suspicious cultists, gather all the evidence, and reveal the Truth to the world!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two parallel investigations that you pursue in any order<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual black-and-white visuals mixed with real photographs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather evidence, connect the facts – build your own version of events<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of noir investigation and absurdity: disappearances, cults, mad scientists, and evil corporations! And maybe even aliens…<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate witnesses: pressure them, empathize, eavesdrop – unravel the tangle of secrets!<\/p>","short_description":"Witnesses is a detective visual novel in a grim noir style. You are a private detective assigned two strange cases.","supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5304140\/70d6630aec05cc0f14673b2aec4557e11ea75985\/header.jpg?t=1793730403","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5304140\/45768cca9c473cf37b9f1ea646ac56385a687305\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793730403","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5304140\/45768cca9c473cf37b9f1ea646ac56385a687305\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793730403","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 x64<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 x64<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Unexpected Cucumbers"],"publishers":["Gamesforfarm"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":199,"final":159,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$1.99","final_formatted":"$1.59"},"packages":[1833389],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Witnesses","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1833389,"percent_s